[2.099, "o", "# Score report: Extract fields from invoice\r\n"]
[2.219, "o", "**ASSIST ONLY**: Use it to draft, keep a human on every case.\r\n"]
[2.339, "o", "Pass rate 93.3% [84.1%, 97.4%] is well short of the 95% target and no confident subset reaches it; useful as a draft-generator, not as an unattended step.\r\n"]
