[3.059, "o", "| Target | 95% |\r\n"]
[3.179, "o", "| Calibration error | 0.13 (well calibrated) |\r\n"]
[3.299, "o", "The pass rate is reported with a 95% confidence interval. With 60 cases the true rate could plausibly be anywhere in that range, which is why the interval and not the headline number drives the decision.\r\n"]
